oterapia nel trattamento del carcinsarcoma dell'ovaio</article-title><source>Minerva Ginecol</source><year>1999</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>445</fpage><lpage>448</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Minerva Ginecol||51|445||bib5|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10726444</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Morrow</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name><name><surname>D'Ablaing</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Brady</surname><given-names>LW</given-names></name><name><surname>Blessing</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hreshchyshyn</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A clinical pathological study of 30 cases of malignant mixed mullerian tumours: a gynaecological oncology group study</article-title><source>Gynaecol Oncol</source><year>1984</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>278</fpage><lpage>292</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Gynaecol Oncol||18|278||bib6|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Newlands</surname><given-names>ES</given-names></name><name><surname>Paradinas</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ovarian germ cell and other rare ovarian tumours</article-title><source>Oxford Textbook of Oncology. Volume 1</source><year>1995</year><publisher-name>Oxford: Oxford University Press</publisher-name><fpage>1320</fpage><lpage>1324</lpage>Peckham M, Pineda HM, Veronesi U (eds) pp</citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Prendiville</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Murphy</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Rennison</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Buckley</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surnam